    "en": "The same road and the same j-pop taste as the superfan preset, but the oshi list is EMPTY (oshi_mode stays off, no artists registered at all) — the starkest possible contrast with the superfan's 3-artist, differing-熱狂度 list. With the gate closed, no registered oshi, and no history to fall back on, no track's own-artist match can fire — a different track wins on taste alone, isolating exactly what the multi-artist oshi list itself contributes.",
